Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:43.39,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“If Claude can build it in a
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:43.39,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}day, why would anyone pay
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:43.39,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}you for it?”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's maybe not even like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.16,0:00:01.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,go-to-market
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.76,0:00:04.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,but I was giving a talk
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:06.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,yesterday to a sort of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:08.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,full hacker house
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:10.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,and one of the things I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.43,0:00:12.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,said was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.09,0:00:13.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Look, if you can build
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.65,0:00:14.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,something in a day with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.79,0:00:15.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Claude, like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:16.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,why would anyone else
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.73,0:00:17.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,pay you for that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.37,0:00:18.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,right? Like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.35,0:00:19.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,they can do the same
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:20.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,thing. The bar is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.59,0:00:21.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,like, much higher now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:22.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,for, like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.19,0:00:24.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,good software or
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:24.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,software that's valuable
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:25.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,enough for people to buy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.82,0:00:26.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,it from you instead of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:28.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,from other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:29.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,So, you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.08,0:00:29.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,I do think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.74,0:00:31.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,like, you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:32.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,a modicum of sort of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:33.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,effort or
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:34.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,like, how defensible is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.46,0:00:35.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,this thing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:37.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think has raised the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:38.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,bar for what kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:39.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,software actually makes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.42,0:00:40.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,sense to build anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:40.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,and what software makes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:42.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,sense to kind of try to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.24,0:00:43.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,sell.
